83
00:03:31,780 --> 00:03:33,420
(When he's curious, he immediately goes to find out.)

84
00:03:33,990 --> 00:03:35,490
(Wherever he goes, he's a happy, free traveller.)

85
00:03:36,820 --> 00:03:38,190
