- You have so many Japanese fans.

214
00:08:13,300 --> 00:08:14,300
Seriously.

215
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:19,670
(He recently had fan meet-ups in Osaka and Tokyo.)

216
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:23,640
("Kim Nam Gil, Sells Out First Japan Fan Tour")

217
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:26,610
(Japan fell in love with Hallyu Star Kim Nam Gil.)

218
00:08:28,250 --> 00:08:30,480
I saw that Nam Gil sang 21 songs...

219
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:33,050
- at this fan meet-up.
- Right. Is that true?

220
00:08:34,250 --> 00:08:36,350
I mean... That's...

221
