231
00:08:58,210 --> 00:08:59,640
"Why aren't they coming back home?"

232
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:01,310
- In the article...
- Yes?

233
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:04,280
Since it wouldn't end, at 11pm...

234
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,980
You know, fans who are students...

235
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:09,620
