236
00:09:09,620 --> 00:09:10,960
Right, they get rides.

237
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:14,690
She posted, "Nam Gil, you'll let my daughter go home, right?

238
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:15,990
(The same day, 1 hour)

239
00:09:15,990 --> 00:09:17,160
(The same day, 2 hours)

240
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,260
(The same day, 3 hours)

241
00:09:18,260 --> 00:09:19,360
(The same day, 4 hours)

242
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,360
(The same day, 5 hours)

243
00:09:21,030 --> 00:09:23,870
(Like that, he went for 5 hours and 40 minutes.)

244
00:09:25,170 --> 00:09:26,200
(Nam Gil, can you let my daughter go?)

245
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,270
(Are fan meet-ups always this long?)

246
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:30,070
So I said, "I do let fans go home."

247
00:09:30,740 --> 00:09:32,940
