250
00:09:38,420 --> 00:09:40,950
So when I get the chance,

251
00:09:40,950 --> 00:09:43,190
I want to make memories, to put it nicely.

252
00:09:43,190 --> 00:09:44,190
Your fans...

253
00:09:44,190 --> 00:09:47,460
